{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1739.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"9b487f3cd72647085e0b92475f968e804800bf0ef994b6fd44a1addb11a3678f","ja":"あ、ステージ見てる人がいる！","zh":"啊，有人在看舞台呢！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1739.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"69b1b697a922c656c9c5a43f2d1520fbfafac3fda9f83d2cb692d16f7a666bcd","ja":"けど、まだ準備中だから、すぐ離れちゃったな。\n……いいね、そうこなくっちゃ。","zh":"不过，因为还在准备中，马上就走开了呢。\n……不错，就该这样嘛。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1739.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"a051c29c8881022b3b37c158d1a96d8e1807b775d82c3dc163bb19b0dcf22a2a","ja":"うん、すっごく楽しみだよ♪\nどれくらいの人が立ち止まってくれるかな？","zh":"嗯，我非常期待哦♪\n会有多少人停下脚步来看呢？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1739.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"b291e1646746b4bc1dba1063fa6d939bd877be23eddd4eef82c066234dab3048","ja":"あたしの歌とギターで、\n通る人全員を釘付けにしてみせるぜ！","zh":"我要用自己的歌声和吉他，\n把所有路过的人都牢牢吸引住！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1739.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"4f040a03cdd8f30fca526643278e25d905eae1ba89a6b1618d6673a40a1f81c5","ja":"アタシのダンスだって、負けないよ！\nとびっきりのを披露するからさ。","zh":"我的舞技也不会输的哦！\n会给你展现一段绝妙的舞蹈呢。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1739.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"ab7670dd17e839590cbfc34af43b07d3aef2d6095547e433cc80151dcbedbe40","ja":"「ジュリアさん、歩さん！\nスタンバイお願いしまーす！」","zh":"「茱莉亚、步！\n请准备就位——！」","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1739.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"c869ddb64b4ba36d93835a34d6972ea2eef915a68a5b152ba0c5d3161642f67c","ja":"はーい！　よし、それじゃあ行こうか！","zh":"好～！好，那就出发吧！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1739.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"6b342c24e5eee9a5db6afe924f094a148c49e628e7fa59990c19404435a09f6f","ja":"ああ！　この場に居合わせた幸運を感じてもらうぜ！\n……なんてな♪","zh":"啊啊！一定会让他们体会到恰好在场的幸运！\n……开玩笑的啦♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1739.unity3d","item_key":"commands[22].text","source_sha256":"e1fc20c14ba977916bc7b6cce393da3f968448edb4f02a9b8acc9cd8d620e3d9","ja":"やあ、みんな！　突然だけど、\nよかったらウチらに付き合ってくれないか？","zh":"嗨，大家好！虽然有点突然，\n但要是可以的话，能陪陪我们吗？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1739.unity3d","item_key":"commands[23].text","source_sha256":"a00235403f2e9aafadea466ab6f12d4b54109c748e002b4dea9c899340b6076b","ja":"「あれ？　どっかで見たような」「何が始まるの！？」\n「えっ！　ジュリアちゃんと歩ちゃん！？」","zh":"「咦？好像在哪里见过」「要开始演什么了吗！？」\n「哎！是茱莉亚和小步！？」","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1739.unity3d","item_key":"commands[24].text","source_sha256":"960247501f04d33da80c3df86bcb62c85837ec2c64433c7e89ee409839eeb480","ja":"知ってくれてる人もいるんだ。\n舞浜歩だよ！　ダンスにはちょっと自信あるかな♪","zh":"也有人认识我呀。\n我是舞滨步哦！对跳舞还是挺有自信的♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1739.unity3d","item_key":"commands[25].text","source_sha256":"0a790ad89081362074c53c2e7df8ad0284ed7f16c5f81ffc82e9dbf42b0bffe9","ja":"あたしはジュリア。\n雑踏の中に、ギターと歌声を響かせにきたぜ。","zh":"我是茱莉亚。\n我来这喧嚣的人群中，让吉他和歌声响彻全场了。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1739.unity3d","item_key":"commands[26].text","source_sha256":"6cda5e43f06fcb15ca4a6c131dc86201135cf7ee0dc2e99c65eebdb6aadf7237","ja":"それじゃあ始めようか……\n一日かぎりの、とびっきり自由なパフォーマンス！","zh":"那么就开始吧……\n仅限这一天的、无比自由的表演！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
